msgid "Find cut locations, given a maximum of 4 qubits per subcircuit. This circuit can be separated in two by making a single wire cut and cutting one `CRZGate` {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-cutting-one-crzgate}"
