#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add ancillas for wire cuts and expand the observables to account for ancilla qubits {#add-ancillas-for-wire-cuts-and-expand-the-observables-to-account-for-ancilla-qubits}"
msgstr "הוספת ancillas לחתכי חוט והרחבת האובזרבלות כדי להתחשב ב-Qubit של ה-ancilla {#add-ancillas-for-wire-cuts-and-expand-the-observables-to-account-for-ancilla-qubits}"

